 # Panacode overlay
 
+## Install (isolated from OpenCode)
+
+Panacode must **never** write OpenCode’s dirs (`~/.opencode`, XDG `…/opencode`).
+
+```bash
+# From this repo (needs Bun: https://bun.sh)
+./install-panacode --from-source
+# then open a new shell
+panacode --help
+```
+
+| Thing | OpenCode | Panacode |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Install bin | `~/.opencode/bin/opencode` | `~/.panacode/bin/panacode` |
+| XDG app name | `opencode` | `panacode` |
+| Config override | `OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR` | `PANACODE_CONFIG_DIR` (falls back to OpenCode env) |
+| Logs | `opencode.log` | `panacode.log` |
+
+Auth/API defaults to PanaAI at `https://panaai-psi.vercel.app` (see `Product` in `packages/core/src/panacode/product.ts`).
+
+
 Panacode is a product fork of [OpenCode](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode) (`dev`). The goal is a thin, reversible overlay: branding + a PanaAI-only connect catalog, without rewriting agent/tool mechanics.
 
 ## Product defaults
